WEBVTT

00:07:29.632 --> 00:07:33.188
As a team, they go out
and visit people who have overdosed

00:07:33.212 --> 00:07:36.116
within 72 hours of that resuscitation.

00:07:36.427 --> 00:07:37.595
They talk.

00:07:37.619 --> 00:07:38.784
They listen.

00:07:38.808 --> 00:07:41.174
They build a rapport with that patient,

00:07:41.198 --> 00:07:43.295
and they offer them treatment options.

00:07:47.650 --> 00:07:52.761
Right now, about 30 percent
or up to 30 percent

00:07:52.785 --> 00:07:57.155
of those that the Quick Response Team
have reached out to

00:07:57.179 --> 00:07:59.312
have accepted some form of help.